nded=\"false\" class=\"lg:hidden inline-flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:9999px;border:2px solid var(--color-ink);background:transparent;color:var(--color-ink)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></header><main style=\"flex:1\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"Paws&Tales\",\"url\":\"https://paws-tales.com\",\"description\":\"Stories, science, and warmth — for everyone who shares a life with dogs.\"}</script><section style=\"background:var(--color-primary)\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 py-16 lg:py-24 grid lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center\" style=\"max-width:1444px\"><div><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:var(--color-ink);padding:6px 16px;border-radius:9999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:24px\">A friendly journal for dog people</span><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);color:var(--color-on-primary);margin-bottom:24px\">Kindness, in every wag.</h1><p style=\"font-size:20px;color:var(--color-on-primary);font-weight:500;line-height:1.5;max-width:560px;margin-bottom:32px\">Stories, science, and warmth — for everyone who shares a life with dogs.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"background:var(--color-ink);color:var(--color-primary);border-radius:32px;padding:0 28px;height:56px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border:2px solid var(--color-ink)\" href=\"/blog\">Read the journal</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"background:transparent;color:var(--color-ink);border-radius:32px;padding:0 28px;height:56px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border:2px solid var(--color-ink)\" href=\"/categories\">Browse categories</a></div></div><div class=\"relative\" style=\"border-radius:32px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:5 / 4;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.18)\"><img alt=\"A happy golden dog running through a meadow\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450778869180-41d0601e046e?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1600&amp;q=80\"/></div></div></section><section style=\"background:var(--color-canvas);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-hairline-soft)\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 py-10\" style=\"max-width:1444px\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-6 mb-6\"><div><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display)\">What can we help you with?</h2><p style=\"color:var(--color-muted);margin-top:8px;font-size:16px\">Pick a starting point — every guide is friendly, kind, and evidence-based.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4\"><a style=\"background:var(--color-surface-cream);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline-soft);transition:background 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;min-height:120px\" class=\"hover:bg-[var(--color-surface)] hover:-translate-y-0.5\" href=\"/categories/training\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.2\">Training</span><span style=\"color:var(--color-muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.4\">Kind, evidence-based training so your dog grows into a confident companion.</span></a><a style=\"background:var(--color-surface-cream);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline-soft);transition:background 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;min-height:120px\" class=\"hover:bg-[var(--color-surface)] hover:-translate-y-0.5\" href=\"/categories/understanding-your-dog\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.2\">Understanding Your Dog</span><span style=\"color:var(--color-muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.4\">Reading the signals, the science of doggy emotions, and what your friend is really telling you.</span></a><a style=\"background:var(--color-surface-cream);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline-soft);transition:background 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;min-height:120px\" class=\"hover:bg-[var(--color-surface)] hover:-translate-y-0.5\" href=\"/categories/getting-a-dog\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.2\">Getting a Dog</span><span style=\"color:var(--color-muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.4\">From first thoughts to first walk home</span></a><a style=\"background:var(--color-surface-cream);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline-soft);transition:background 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;min-height:120px\" class=\"hover:bg-[var(--color-surface)] hover:-translate-y-0.5\" href=\"/categories/health-wellbeing\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.2\">Health &amp; Wellbeing</span><span style=\"color:var(--color-muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.4\">Vet-reviewed guides on everyday care, warning signs, and life-stage health.</span></a><a style=\"background:var(--color-surface-cream);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline-soft);transition:background 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;min-height:120px\" class=\"hover:bg-[var(--color-surface)] hover:-translate-y-0.5\" href=\"/categories/life-with-your-dog\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.2\">Life With Your Dog</span><span style=\"color:var(--color-muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.4\">Travel, holidays, families, and the everyday joys of dog life.</span></a><a style=\"background:var(--color-surface-cream);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border:1px solid var(--color-hairline-soft);transition:background 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;min-height:120px\" class=\"hover:bg-[var(--color-surface)] hover:-translate-y-0.5\" href=\"/categories/puppy-care\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.2\">Puppy Care</span><span style=\"color:var(--color-muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.4\">The first weeks and months</span></a></div></div></section><section style=\"background:var(--color-surface-soft)\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 py-16 lg:py-24 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center\" style=\"max-width:1444px\"><div class=\"relative\" style=\"border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:5 / 4;box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)\"><img alt=\"Dry Eye Syndrome in Dogs: A Complete Guide to Keratoconjunctivitis Sicca Treatment\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587300003388-59208cc962cb?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=80\"/></div><div><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-ink);padding:4px 14px;border-radius:9999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px\">Featured story</span><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);margin-bottom:16px\">Dry Eye Syndrome in Dogs: A Complete Guide to Keratoconjunctivitis Sicca Treatment</h2><p style=\"font-size:18px;color:var(--color-body);margin-bottom:24px;line-height:1.6\">Learn about dry eye syndrome (keratoconjunctivitis sicca) in dogs — symptoms, causes, treatment options, and when to see a vet for your furry friend.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"background:transparent;color:var(--color-ink);border-radius:32px;padding:0 24px;height:48px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border:2px solid var(--color-ink)\" href=\"/blog/dry-eye-syndrome-dogs-keratoconjunctivitis-sicca-treatment\">Read the full story</a></div></div></section><section class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2\" style=\"background:var(--color-primary)\"><div class=\"px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 py-16 lg:py-20 flex items-center\" style=\"background:var(--color-primary)\"><div style=\"max-width:540px;margin-left:auto\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);color:var(--color-on-primary);margin-bottom:20px\">Will you help dogs live their best life?</h2><p style=\"font-size:18px;color:var(--color-on-primary);font-weight:500;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:28px\">Our authors — vets, trainers, behaviour specialists — write to help dogs and their humans understand each other a little more every week. Read their work, share what helps you, tell a friend.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"background:var(--color-ink);color:var(--color-primary);border-radius:32px;padding:0 28px;height:56px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border:2px solid var(--color-ink)\" href=\"/authors\">Meet our authors</a></div></div><div style=\"background:var(--color-canvas);position:relative;min-height:320px\"><img alt=\"A small terrier resting on a cushion\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576201836106-db1758fd1c97?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=80\"/></div></section><section style=\"background:var(--color-canvas)\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 py-16 lg:py-24\" style=\"max-width:1444px\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-6 mb-10\"><div><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display)\">Our latest updates</h2><p style=\"color:var(--color-muted);margin-top:8px;font-size:16px\">Fresh notes from our authors, every week.</p></div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center self-start md:self-auto\" style=\"background:transparent;color:var(--color-ink);border-radius:32px;padding:0 24px;height:48px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border:2px solid var(--color-ink)\" href=\"/blog\">See all articles</a></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8\"><a style=\"background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:0 0 9px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);transition:transform 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease\" class=\"group hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]\" href=\"/training/training-tips-for-stubborn-dogs\"><div class=\"relative\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4 / 3\"><img alt=\"Training Tips for Stubborn Dogs: A Complete Guide to Winning Cooperation\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/A1f835ff6cd2c44cdb02d2959c41ff3610.jpg\"/></div><div style=\"padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;flex:1\"><span style=\"align-self:flex-start;background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-ink);border-radius:9999px;padding:4px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.1px;text-transform:uppercase\">Training</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:24px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.2;margin:0\">Training Tips for Stubborn Dogs: A Complete Guide to Winning Cooperation</h3><p style=\"color:var(--color-body);font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden\">Discover proven training tips for stubborn dogs. Learn step-by-step techniques, common mistakes to avoid, and expert strategies to transform your willful pup.</p><span style=\"margin-top:auto;font-size:13px;color:var(--color-muted);font-weight:500\">Beth Carrasco</span></div></a><a style=\"background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:0 0 9px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);transition:transform 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease\" class=\"group hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]\" href=\"/health-wellbeing/inflammatory-bowel-disease-dogs-diet-medication-management\"><div class=\"relative\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4 / 3\"><img alt=\"Inflammatory Bowel Disease in Dogs: Diet, Medication &amp; Management Guide\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/A87aac36c65014cefb7452d4b533d0460E.jpg\"/></div><div style=\"padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;flex:1\"><span style=\"align-self:flex-start;background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-ink);border-radius:9999px;padding:4px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.1px;text-transform:uppercase\">Health &amp; Wellbeing</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:24px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.2;margin:0\">Inflammatory Bowel Disease in Dogs: Diet, Medication &amp; Management Guide</h3><p style=\"color:var(--color-body);font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden\">Learn about inflammatory bowel disease in dogs, including symptoms, causes, dietary strategies, medication options, and long-term management tips.</p><span style=\"margin-top:auto;font-size:13px;color:var(--color-muted);font-weight:500\">Beth Carrasco</span></div></a><a style=\"background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:0 0 9px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);transition:transform 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease\" class=\"group hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]\" href=\"/training/training-tips-for-deaf-dogs\"><div class=\"relative\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4 / 3\"><img alt=\"Training Tips for Deaf Dogs: A Complete Guide to Hand Signals, Bonding &amp;amp; Success\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Ac6c5c5d93ae74f67ac382d66051519d6y.jpg\"/></div><div style=\"padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;flex:1\"><span style=\"align-self:flex-start;background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-ink);border-radius:9999px;padding:4px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.1px;text-transform:uppercase\">Training</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:24px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.2;margin:0\">Training Tips for Deaf Dogs: A Complete Guide to Hand Signals, Bonding &amp;amp; Success</h3><p style=\"color:var(--color-body);font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden\">Discover proven training tips for deaf dogs including hand signals, attention techniques, safety strategies, and common mistakes to avoid. Start today!</p><span style=\"margin-top:auto;font-size:13px;color:var(--color-muted);font-weight:500\">Anouk Beaumont</span></div></a><a style=\"background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:0 0 9px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);transition:transform 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease\" class=\"group hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]\" href=\"/health-wellbeing/hemangiosarcoma-dogs-early-detection-treatment-prognosis\"><div class=\"relative\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4 / 3\"><img alt=\"Hemangiosarcoma in Dogs: Early Detection, Treatment Options &amp; Prognosis Guide\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Aea11ffae96124c2593507f705d456d58r.jpg\"/></div><div style=\"padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;flex:1\"><span style=\"align-self:flex-start;background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-ink);border-radius:9999px;padding:4px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.1px;text-transform:uppercase\">Health &amp; Wellbeing</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:24px;color:var(--color-ink);line-height:1.2;margin:0\">Hemangiosarcoma in Dogs: Early Detection, Treatment Options &amp; Prognosis Guide</h3><p style=\"color:var(--color-body);font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden\">Learn about hemangiosarcoma in dogs — symptoms, causes, early detection tips, treatment options &amp; prognosis. A comprehensive guide for pet owners.</p><span style=\"margin-top:auto;font-size:13px;color:var(--color-muted);font-weight:500\">Aaron Whyte</span></div></a><a style=\"background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:0 0 9px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);transition:transform 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease\" class=\"group hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_6px_18px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]\" href=\"/training/dog-training-tips-video\"><div class=\"relative\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4 / 3\"><img alt=\"Dog Training Tips Video: The Ultimate Visual Guid